      "createdAt": "120326123654",
      "description": "Due to urgent maintenance work on the main water pipeline, water supply in Visavada village will remain suspended tomorrow from 9:00 AM to 3:00 PM. Residents are requested to store sufficient water in advance. We regret the inconvenience caused.",
